<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 3.0 bln Luf step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 3.0 bln Luf step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Europeen-Banque Bruxelles Lambert.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON  ** 6.00	MATURITY    27.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.75    PAY DATE  S-27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.38 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE, 7.0 PCT YEARS SIX TO EIGHT,</p>
